        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Skyline Entry Plate, Fusion E-V9</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFusion Hardware's Skyline Keyed Entry Plate has a simple rectangular design that is only made better by the addition of Fusion's many knob or lever choices. It is constructed from solid brass and is finished in your choice of oil rubbed bronze satin nickel or polished chrome. It will fit all standard 5-1/2 inch on center door borings.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/skyline-handleset-fusion-w1\"><b>Matching Skyline Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Skyline Entry Set Fusion E-V9:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Skyline Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the latch underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob on both the inside and the outside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> This is a non-functional piece for looks only used to match trim for inactive door. It does not latch and it does not lock.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Skyline Rectangular Entry Plate, Fusion E-V9",
                "description": "Fusion Hardware's Skyline Keyed Entry Plate has a simple design that is only made better by the additon of the Empire lever. It is made out of solid brass and is finished in oil rubbed bronze.  It will fit all standard 5-1/2 inch on center door borings.",
